{#
  BeMart Help — 特定商取引法に基づく表記 (EC-CUBE goHelpTradeLaw).

  PORT of EC-CUBE 4.3 default-theme `Help/tradelaw.twig`
  (src/Eccube/Resource/template/default/Help/tradelaw.twig).

  Markup skeleton, `ec-role` / `ec-pageHeader` / `ec-off1Grid` /
  `ec-borderedDefs` / `ec-label` classes and the `<dl>`/`<dt>`/`<dd>`
  block structure are kept verbatim from EC-CUBE. The dynamic bindings
  are rebound to the Help/TradeLaw resource body
  (src/Resource/Page/Help/TradeLaw.php):
    staticContent.sections[] { label (tradeLawName),
                               value (tradeLawDescription) }

  EC-CUBE's `tradelaw.twig` iterates `tradelaws|filter(t => t.name and
  t.description)` — the 特定商取引法 disclosure rows (事業者情報、返品ポリシー、
  送料 ...) edited from the admin TradeLaw screen. BeMart has no TradeLaw
  aggregation yet (Help/TradeLaw is a Wave 3H pure renderer), so the
  resource body carries an EMPTY `staticContent.sections` list — exactly
  EC-CUBE's empty `ec-borderedDefs` skeleton when no tradelaw row has
  both name and description. The port's `{% for %}` is already the
  name-and-value filtered shape (the resource only emits complete rows),
  so it matches EC-CUBE's `|filter(...)` semantics. The populated rows
  are flagged as a MISSING BODY FIELD follow-up: a TradeLaw aggregation
  must surface tradeLawName / tradeLawDescription pairs into
  `staticContent.sections`. Enumerated as residual in
  tests/Resource/HelpTradeLawHtmlRenderTest.php.

  EC-CUBE-ism rebinding (see var/templates/README.md):
   - `{{ 'front.tradelaw.title'|trans }}` -> the ja literal
     "特定商取引法に基づく表記". EC-CUBE's `<h1>` carries a leading space
     before the binding; kept verbatim.
   - `description|purify` — EC-CUBE HTML-purifies admin-entered prose.
     The resource body carries already-safe text, so the port renders
     it directly; the purify pass is an EC-CUBE-runtime concern.
#}
{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% set route = 'help-trade-law' %}
{% set title = '特定商取引法に基づく表記' %}

{% block main %}
    <div class="ec-role">
        <div class="ec-pageHeader">
            <h1> 特定商取引法に基づく表記</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="ec-off1Grid">
            <div class="ec-off1Grid__cell">
                <div class="ec-borderedDefs">
                    {% for section in staticContent.sections %}
                    <dl>
                        <dt>
                            <label class="ec-label">{{ section.label }}</label>
                        </dt>
                        <dd>{{ section.value }}</dd>
                    </dl>
                    {% endfor %}
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
{% endblock %}
